What: /sys/bus/slimbus/devices/es705-codec-gen0/fw_version
Date: October 2026
KernelVersion: 3.10
Description:
	Read-only firmware version obtained from the EF67 ES705 after its
	firmware has been loaded. Each read wakes the chip, queries its
	current version and, if no audio route is using the chip, puts it
	back to sleep with its clock disabled. Active routes remain awake.
	Returns EAGAIN until initialization completes, including after a
	SLIMbus reset. Communication errors are returned to the reader.
